s—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >learn to read and predict enemy behavior to stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Dogs Harmed : </strong>Even enemy attack dogs are off-limits.Do not shoot dogs.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271690/extras/f4f3ad0f1471b05fb0808fd7521e9585.poster.avif?t=1781142676\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271690/extras/f4f3ad0f1471b05fb0808fd7521e9585.webm?t=1781142676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271690/extras/f4f3ad0f1471b05fb0808fd7521e9585.mp4?t=1781142676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271690/extras/3d47f7357b9542fdbc127d3e21cc98c8.apng?t=1781142676\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271690/extras/3d47f7357b9542fdbc127d3e21cc98c8.poster.avif?t=1781142676\" class=\"bb_img\" width=780 height=48 /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Arcade Experience : </strong>Fast-paced, challenging, and brutally satisfying—a true tribute to the arcade era.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful Yet Restrained Gunplay : </strong>Every shot counts. Experience tactical shooting within a high-speed action game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revenge for Your Dog : </strong>Yes. Sometimes, wiping out hundreds of enemies only takes one reason.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Leaderboards : </strong>Compete worldwide and prove yourself as the ultimate “Red Avenger.”</p></li></ul><p 